      "householdToIndividual": "use the official wealth-decile × income-decile household-count matrix and same-year income-quintile household sizes to estimate the average household size of each wealth decile; convert each wealth threshold with the adjacent wealth-decile household-size estimates and convert household counts to estimated people, then normalize to the fixed all-Taiwan population",
